# The cotangent obstruction class and the canonical element

This file completes the construction of the cotangent obstruction class of a dual deformation
situation: the class on `NL_{A/Λ}` whose evaluation at every square-zero thickening is that
thickening's obstruction element and whose image in `H¹(K ⊗ᴸ Ω_{A/Λ})` is the canonical element
of the tangent functor.

